NNOOTTEESS
     At most 8 terminal windows can exist at once - one pseudo-
     terminal pair each.  The shell is /bbiinn/sshh regardless of en-
     vironment.  A paste is limited to 1024 bytes, and the tty
     driver itself accepts at most 255 characters in one input
     line.  The scrollback is dropped, oldest first, when memory
     runs short.  hhrrppuummpp is zztteerrmm's internal I/O helper and does
     nothing useful run by hand.
